stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> assigned: rule, plan or worker report
    assigned --> accepted: owner accepts
    assigned --> escalated: not accepted by the start-by time
    assigned --> cancelled: HSE only
    accepted --> in_progress: started
    in_progress --> reported_complete: reported done
    reported_complete --> verified: evidence at the required tier
    reported_complete --> disputed: worker says "This didn't happen"
    disputed --> escalated: to the HSE owner, reporter hidden
    escalated --> accepted: HSE accepts
    accepted --> escalated
    in_progress --> escalated
    disputed --> in_progress
    verified --> reopened: worker disputes later
    reopened --> assigned
    verified --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    note right of disputed
        Resolved only by someone outside
        the supervisor's line, with their own
        E3 or E4 check made after the dispute
        and a written finding. The worker is
        told and can challenge again.
    end note
    classDef good fill:#0E2548,stroke:#60A5FA,stroke-width:2px,color:#DBEAFE
    classDef warnS fill:#3A1C0B,stroke:#F97316,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFEDD5
    classDef bad fill:#3A0D12,stroke:#EF4444,stroke-width:2px,color:#FEE2E2
    classDef base fill:#13203A,stroke:#3B82F6,stroke-width:2px,color:#F4F7FC
    class verified good
    class reported_complete warnS
    class disputed, escalated, reopened bad
    class assigned, accepted, in_progress base
